{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Exert your energy to climb up, you looo~ser\u2661</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/77f6dc79258d6c4fb35b2ee0283d570f.avif?t=1765167138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras_big/77f6dc79258d6c4fb35b2ee0283d570f.webp?t=1765167138 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yahoo yahoo\u2661 I'm here to play with you\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's take on the challenge of &quot;ZAKO NO AHIRU&quot; together\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I heard it's an insanely tough game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to control a stubborn little ducky and climb to the top of the mountain\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can't wait to see you struggle and suffer\u2661\u2661\u2661</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661How to play\u2661</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/4bc048b7fbf01522e1a2d0cdb4fe7f76.poster.avif?t=1765167138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/4bc048b7fbf01522e1a2d0cdb4fe7f76.webm?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/4bc048b7fbf01522e1a2d0cdb4fe7f76.mp4?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's super easy to operate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make the little ducky spray water from its mouth with a &quot;pew pew&quot; sound\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you can fly right over to the next platform~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/f84bf121992eb1f993542e70eee0786e.poster.avif?t=1765167138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/f84bf121992eb1f993542e70eee0786e.webm?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/f84bf121992eb1f993542e70eee0786e.mp4?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But... Nothing is always in plain sailing\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because there's a chance of moving backward, it's actually pretty tough!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you might mess up and fall off, forcing you to start all over again~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/dae4c33e4aa9dda954f387182d39793a.poster.avif?t=1765167138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/dae4c33e4aa9dda954f387182d39793a.webm?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/dae4c33e4aa9dda954f387182d39793a.mp4?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Putting unnecessary pressure on someone is so lame, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I won't let any foolish mistakes slide, you know \u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My sharp tongue is suuuper\u2014powerful, so you better be prepared~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giving up so easily is just pathetic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got to hold on till the very end \u2661\u2661\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/07c646130679521c63bd39f256dc83f2.poster.avif?t=1765167138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/07c646130679521c63bd39f256dc83f2.webm?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/07c646130679521c63bd39f256dc83f2.mp4?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I knew you could clear it \u2661\u2661\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you looking at me? Since when???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I-I'm not happy for you or anything...!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661Rescue UFO incoming!?\u2661</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/7c2ad0a57b6b3d1216f91b90d6ffe486.poster.avif?t=1765167138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/7c2ad0a57b6b3d1216f91b90d6ffe486.webm?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/7c2ad0a57b6b3d1216f91b90d6ffe486.mp4?t=1765167138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are times when everyone just can't hold on any longer, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone 